A concurrent workspace process produced a second, stronger implementation while I was testing the first. I’m preserving that work rather than overwriting it: it stays in the paper’s Boolean-matrix domain, adds an executable fooling-set certificate of minimality, and compresses the factors into exact affine triples. I’m auditing that implementation and its measurements now.
