%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%

We performed experiments of the parameterized algorithms on the {\it
Culex pipiens} dataset, given in Table~\ref{t:cdata}. We implemented
the algorithms in the C++ programming language, with source code of
approximately 2500 lines.

