+
+Final disposition. The repository-owned oracle loop defeated easy (2/3 exact
+solves), medium (3/3), hard (2/3), and the first custom escalation p=101,
+blocks=3 (3/3). The statement's named moment summaries made the compact route
+too directly executable. This retained module therefore fails H on Track B and
+must not be emitted as an accepted family; see REJECTED.md.
 """.strip()
 
 

